# Purpose

This document defines the visual design standards that establish a consistent, modern, and premium user interface across the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure that every interface communicates clarity, consistency, and professionalism while remaining aligned with the product vision and Engineering Constitution.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Visual hierarchy
* Information architecture
* Dashboard design
* Design governance

It intentionally excludes typography, color systems, animations, accessibility, and implementation details, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to visual design, ensuring every interface contributes to a coherent, maintainable, and user-centered product experience.

---

# Required Reading

1. Engineering Constitution

Recommended:

